Original author comments are intentionally retained in the corresponding files.

The included parsers are upstream work:
  DualSubs/EXTM3U, version 0.8.8 — GNU GPL version 3
    https://github.com/DualSubs/EXTM3U
  DualSubs/WebVTT, version 2.2.0 — GNU GPL version 3
    https://github.com/DualSubs/WebVTT
